00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:19.490
In all honesty, though, you had a really tough time when you started being an idol.

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:23.380
It's not like I didn't think you weren't just a bit amazing.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:29.050
In all honesty, it's not like I don't think your job is hard at all, Nii-cha-ucha.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:30.680
Non...

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.190
Usacha...

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:34.860
Let's work at being idols together!

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.260
We could sing a duet!

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.540
No, <i>thank</i> you.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.780
You're my enemy, Onee-chan. My rival!

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:41.010
Nii-cha is a sworn foe-ucha!

00:21:41.010 --> 00:21:42.070
What?

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:45.930
There are limits to what even the greatest idol can do alone.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:50.050
I'll find some top-level teammates and beat you once and for all!

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:55.020
And I'll never forgive Nii-cha and Kuma for ruining the Triangle project!

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:56.120
Usacha!

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.980
Non!

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.370
Why are you following me, Onee-chan?

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:06.220
We live together, silly.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:08.220
Man, I'm so annoyed!

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:13.570
I'm so happy you and I can go to PriPara together now!

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.620
That won't happen. We're <i>rivals</i>.

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:17.220
Yep, let's do our best together!

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:19.980
Are you listening? We're rivals, Onee-chan!

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:55.980
I can't believe it! SoLaMi Dressing's going to be in a movie!

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:59.520
And the director's a Pricademy Award-winning auteur!

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:00.620
A clear and serene mind.

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:03.250
Face that which you must your with your unadorned self.

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:05.780
Wait, <i>this</i> is the director?

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:07.160
What <i>is</i> this script?

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:11.880
We've got no choice-pri... We'll use this power and reveal our new selves!

00:24:12.360 --> 00:24:15.810
Next time, <i>Metamorphosis! Jewel Change-poyo ♥</i>!

00:24:15.810 --> 00:24:16.840
"Poyo"?

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
